#!args --check
# physicstest is a console program: every test group of lib/physics against its references (math, hull,
# ray, distance, cast, tunnel, seams, bvh, world, fuzz, edge) and of the character controller (character,
# charfuzz); exit code 1 when a check fails.  The determinism checksums (--checksum) are compared across the
# targets by hand (docs/PHYSICS.md, "Prüfsummen").
